OL,3,GNEWSALetting agent failed to protect
OL,4,Atenant deposits, say landlords
OL,5,
OL,6,FLandlords who were customers of a
OL,7,Fletting agency have said they are owed
OL,8,Fthousands of pounds in unpaid rent and
OL,9,Funprotected tenant deposits.
OL,11,FThe BBC has heard directly from nine
OL,12,Flandlords who say they are owed money
OL,13,Fby J&R Property Specialists, a company
OL,14,Fthat was based in the New Forest in
OL,15,FHampshire.
OL,17,FThe company, which closed its office in
OL,18,Fthe summer, was responsible for finding
OL,19,Ftenants and managing about 100
OL,20,Fproperties on behalf of landlords. It
OL,21,Fis still registered as an active
OL,22,Fcompany.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
