OL,3,GNEWSALetting agent failed to protect
OL,4,Atenant deposits, say landlords
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sole director of the company, Jaime
OL,7,FCunningham, opened a new letting agency
OL,8,Fin June this year called Revive JL.
